[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-2026-erasmus-mundus-wop-p-scholarship-fully-funded-in-europe-187":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},187,"2026-erasmus-mundus-wop-p-scholarship-fully-funded-in-europe-187","2026 Erasmus Mundus Wop P Scholarship | Fully Funded In Europe","\u003Cp>The Erasmus Mundus WOP P Scholarship supports a two-year master’s in psychology across multiple European universities, covering tuition, monthly stipend, travel, and insurance.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Erasmus Mundus Psychology Masters Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Erasmus Mundus\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-europe\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-Europe\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Europe\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Medical Insurance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 10, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Erasmus Mundus WOP P Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Erasmus Mundus WOP P Scholarship offers to selected candidates:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Participation costs: up to EUR 9,000 per academic year per scholarship holder\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Travel and installation costs: Scholarship holder residing in a Partner Country city located at less than 4,000km from the Coordinating University (University of Valencia):\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Travel costs: EUR 2,000 per academic year.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Installation costs: a single payment of EUR 1,000 to cover the entire study period. Scholarship holder residing in a Partner Country city located at 4,000km or more from the Coordinating University (University of Valencia):\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Travel costs: EUR 3,000 per academic year.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Installation costs: a single payment of EUR 1,000 to cover the entire study period.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Subsistence costs: EUR 1,000 per month for the entire duration of the study period (24 months maximum)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Erasmus Mundus WOP P Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the 2026 Erasmus Mundus WOP P Scholarship applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A Degree in Psychology (i.e., Bachelor of 3, 4 or 5 years)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A full-time commitment to the two-year programme and, for granted students, further commitments as required by the scholarship conditions\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fluency in English (Level B2 under the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Erasmus Mundus Psychology Masters Scholarship Required Documents\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the 2026 Erasmus Mundus WOP P Scholarship, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Certificate of Your Degree in Psychology\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Official academic transcripts\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>CGPA calculation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>CV in English following the \u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002Feuropass.cedefop.europa.eu\u002Fdocuments\u002Fcurriculum-vitae\u002Ftemplates-instructions\">Standard European Format\u003C\u002Fa>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A motivation-letter. Suggestion: between 500 and 1500 words written in English.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Two letters of reference (one preferably academic)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proof of nationality\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp> A certificate of residence.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A recent and formal photo.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>English assessment:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Candidates must provide ONE of the following two documents as proof of English proficiency:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>An official letter from the candidate’s university confirming that they have received instruction in English (the letter must be signed or stamped by the relevant authorities to be considered valid). This letter will be considered equivalent to a C1 level of English proficiency; OR\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>An official English certificate: only Cambridge Assessment English or the Oxford Test of English will be considered.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>b) Candidates who do not provide any of the above-mentioned documents will be assessed by an external company during the selection process (arranged by the WOP-P Master at no cost to the candidate).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Any other document you would like to provide\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Erasmus Mundus WOP P Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the 2026 Erasmus Mundus WOP P Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill in the WOP-P online application form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Register your application at the University of Valencia.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.erasmuswop.org\u002Fhow-to-apply-to-wop-p-master\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.erasmuswop.org\u002Fhow-to-apply-to-wop-p-master\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-27 11:37:32",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2026-erasmus-mundus-wop-p-scholarship-fully-funded-in-europe\u002F69ef3c6c190676.35826135_screenshot 2026-04-27 113148.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u